# HLS Streaming Directory

This directory is used by FFmpeg to store HLS streaming segments (.m3u8 and .ts files).

**Runtime files:**
- `stream.m3u8` - HLS playlist
- `segment_*.ts` - Video segments

**Note:** These files are transient and auto-generated. They are ignored by Git (see .gitignore).

## Directory Structure

```
hls/
??? {camera-id}/
    ??? stream.m3u8
    ??? segment_000.ts
    ??? segment_001.ts
    ??? ...
```

## Permissions

For IIS deployment, ensure the IIS Application Pool has write permissions to this directory:

```powershell
icacls "wwwroot\hls" /grant "IIS AppPool\UnifiCameraDashboard:(OI)(CI)F" /T
```
